      "html": "<p><strong>API changes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li>Deprecate the '-e timeout' runtime parameter in favor of JUnit's Timeout rule.</li>\n <li>Add an AbstractFilter class.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Bug fixes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li>Fix trace errors for long test names</li>\n <li>Handle case where app crashes before instrumentationResultPrinter is set.</li>\n</ul>",
